WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:06.132
(industrial music)

00:00:06.132 --> 00:00:08.705
- Here at EA Sports we
know fans of Madden really

00:00:08.705 --> 00:00:10.747
value authenticity and realness.

00:00:10.747 --> 00:00:13.873
So we work hard to keep Madden
as up to date as possible

00:00:13.873 --> 00:00:16.126
with the latest players, the latest plays

00:00:16.126 --> 00:00:18.376
and now the latest pregame.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.531
Introducing,

00:00:20.531 --> 00:00:21.708
Anthem Mode.

00:00:21.708 --> 00:00:23.805
It's a new add-on for Madden 18.

00:00:23.805 --> 00:00:25.877
- Anthem mode is a storytelling mode,

00:00:25.877 --> 00:00:27.351
where you select a player

00:00:27.351 --> 00:00:28.304
and then you get to choose how

00:00:28.304 --> 00:00:30.752
that player observes the national anthem.

00:00:30.752 --> 00:00:33.524
- You can stand, kneel, sit, link arms,

00:00:33.524 --> 00:00:35.001
stay in the locker room.

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:36.642
- And you can do what's called the tweeny,

00:00:36.642 --> 00:00:39.617
which is between a stand and a kneel.

00:00:39.617 --> 00:00:40.960
It's ambiguous.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:44.062
So everyone gets to see
what they want to see.

00:00:44.062 --> 00:00:45.110
It's the right trigger.

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:46.306
- When they kneel,

00:00:46.306 --> 00:00:48.654
will the blades of grass
move on their knees or...

00:00:48.654 --> 00:00:50.496
- In anthem mode there's no football.

00:00:50.496 --> 00:00:52.879
The pregame is the game.

00:00:52.879 --> 00:00:54.547
- We realize that in 2017,

00:00:54.547 --> 00:00:58.505
being an NFL player isn't
just about football,

00:00:58.505 --> 00:00:59.736
it's about being on the front lines

00:00:59.736 --> 00:01:02.282
of incredibly loaded political theater.

00:01:02.282 --> 00:01:04.308
- Fans love Madden for the strategy

00:01:04.308 --> 00:01:07.161
and anthem mode has tons of strategy.

00:01:07.161 --> 00:01:08.568
Do you kneel?

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.012
There's so many factors.

00:01:10.012 --> 00:01:11.461
What are your teammates doing?

00:01:11.461 --> 00:01:12.972
What city do you play for?

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:14.917
Did your owner donate to Trump?

00:01:14.917 --> 00:01:16.408
- And what if your owner decides

00:01:16.408 --> 00:01:17.767
to join your anthem protest?

00:01:17.767 --> 00:01:18.766
Is he an ally

00:01:18.766 --> 00:01:21.079
or is he just co-opting
your social justice platform

00:01:21.079 --> 00:01:22.341
for positive PR?

00:01:22.341 --> 00:01:24.750
In anthem mode you decide.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.190
- The motion capture suits allow us

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:28.349
to create a 3D representation

00:01:28.349 --> 00:01:29.925
of our talent observing the anthem

00:01:29.925 --> 00:01:34.912
and struggling to figure
out how exactly to do it.

00:01:34.912 --> 00:01:36.999
- You can observe the anthem in any way

00:01:36.999 --> 00:01:40.175
and be literally any player,
except Colin Kaepernick.

00:01:40.175 --> 00:01:41.158
He's still not in the game.

00:01:41.158 --> 00:01:43.542
- This mode's also got the after anthem,

00:01:43.542 --> 00:01:45.048
the Twitter trolls,

00:01:45.048 --> 00:01:47.945
the retired players who
slag you on talk radio.

00:01:47.945 --> 00:01:50.203
We wanted to capture all of it.

00:01:50.203 --> 00:01:51.538
There's 3 difficulty settings:

00:01:51.538 --> 00:01:52.526
easy for beginners,

00:01:52.526 --> 00:01:53.803
medium for white players,

00:01:53.803 --> 00:01:55.352
who just do what everyone else does

00:01:55.352 --> 00:01:57.113
and extremely hard for black players,

00:01:57.113 --> 00:01:58.838
who get criticized either way.

00:01:58.838 --> 00:02:00.283
- At the end of the day,

00:02:00.283 --> 00:02:02.652
we want Madden to be an
authentic representation

00:02:02.652 --> 00:02:04.762
of what happens on Sundays.

00:02:04.762 --> 00:02:08.756
And right now, that's
anthem controversies.

00:02:08.756 --> 00:02:09.890
Oh and concussions,

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.537
we're probably going to add
something about concussions.

